cifically for cargo container assessment. With a corrosion detection performance of 49%, this work showcases the potential of deep learning to automate inspection processes. It also highlights the importance of generalization and training in real-world scenarios and explores innovative solutions for smart gates and terminals.", "作者": ["David Ornelas", "Daniel Canedo", "António J. R. Neves"], "年份": 2025, "发表位置": "Sustainability"}}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740/runs", "run_id": "run_abc3fcaca9164d70ac2d7c7d70a2f67e", "session_key": "b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740", "turn_id": "834e741a-5514-4b36-8a6c-8f05e80a1c81"}
