original YOLOv3 is further improved by introducing a novel transfer learning method, Batch Renormalization and Focal Loss. The improved YOLOv3 is evaluated in terms of average precision and speed. The results show that the improved YOLOv3 has a detection accuracy of up to 80%. Its performance is about 13% better than the original YOLOv3.", "作者": ["Chaobo Zhang", "C. C. Chang", "Maziar Jamshidi"], "年份": 2018, "发表位置": "arXiv"}}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740/runs", "run_id": "run_abc3fcaca9164d70ac2d7c7d70a2f67e", "session_key": "b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740", "turn_id": "834e741a-5514-4b36-8a6c-8f05e80a1c81"}
