results on the capsule defect dataset demonstrate that the proposed method achieves 92.91% mean average precision and 22.16 frames per second. Moreover, its overall performance in terms of training time, model size, detection accuracy, and speed is better than that of the currently popular detectors.", "作者": ["Hao Dong", "Jing Yang", "Jun Wang", "Shaobo Li"], "年份": 2022, "发表位置": "Journal of Sensors"}}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740/runs", "run_id": "run_abc3fcaca9164d70ac2d7c7d70a2f67e", "session_key": "b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740", "turn_id": "834e741a-5514-4b36-8a6c-8f05e80a1c81"}
