ntic inspection and compliance assessment, generating structured reports with contextual reasoning. The framework was validated using the extended MBZIRC Maritime Simulator with realistic port infrastructure and further assessed through real-world robotic inspection trials. The lightweight on-board design ensures suitability for resource-constrained maritime platforms, advancing the development of intelligent, autonomous inspection systems. Project resources (code and videos) can be found here: https://github.com/Muhayyuddin/llm-vlm-fusion-port-inspection", "作者": ["Muhayy Ud Din", "Waseem Akram", "Ahsan B. Bakht", "Irfan Hussain"], "年份": 2026, "发表位置": "arXiv"}}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740/runs", "run_id": "run_abc3fcaca9164d70ac2d7c7d70a2f67e", "session_key": "b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740", "turn_id": "834e741a-5514-4b36-8a6c-8f05e80a1c81"}
