rone to errors. This work aims to fill this gap by proposing a computer vision system that can recognize the SLC type for inventory management and perform defect detection automatically. First, we develop a camera portal, consisting of standard components, that capture the relevant surfaces of the SLC. A labeled dataset of 17,530 images of 34 different SLCs with their...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用计算机视觉系统自动识别可重复使用容器（SLC）的类型并检测其缺陷？",\n        "methods": [\n          "开发了一个由标准组件组成的相机门户，用于捕获SLC的相关表面",\n          "使用ConvNeXt分类模型进行SLC类型识别",\n          "探索了八种最先进的异常检测模型（如PatchCore和DRAEM）用于缺陷检测"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "自建数据集：包含34种不同SLC的17,530张图像及其缺陷状态"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一个完整的计算机视觉系统，能够自动识别SLC类型并进行缺陷检测",\n          "构建了一个包含34种SLC类型和缺陷状态的大规模标注数据集",\n          "通过实验评估了多种异常检测模型在SLC缺陷检测上的性能"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "缺陷检测的最佳模型（PatchCore）AUROC仅为0.811，表明自动化缺陷检测仍有改进空间"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "ConvNeXt分类模型在SLC类型预测上达到100%的准确率",\n          "PatchCore模型在缺陷检测上取得最佳AUROC为0.811",\n          "DRAEM模型在缺陷检测上取得AUROC为0.748"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种计算机视觉系统，用于自动识别可重复使用容器（SLC）的类型并检测其缺陷。系统包括一个相机门户和基于ConvNeXt的分类模型（类型识别准确率100%），以及基于PatchCore和DRAEM的缺陷检测模型（最佳AUROC为0.811）。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 85,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文直接针对用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'，提出了完整的计算机视觉系统，包括类型识别和缺陷检测，且提供了具体的方法、数据集和性能指标，具有较高的相关性和实用性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "indexed",\n      "extraction": {\n        "research_topic": "研究了一种用于可重复使用容器（小型装载容器SLC）的计算机视觉系统，实现类型识别与缺陷检测[paper:p0001]",\n        "research_object": "研究对象为34种不同类型的小型装载容器（SLC），共17,530张图像，其中9,260张图像公开可用[paper:p0001][paper:p0003]",\n        "methods": "使用ConvNeXt分类模型实现SLC类型识别，准确率达100%[paper:p0001]；采用八种最先进异常检测模型（如PatchCore和DRAEM）进行缺陷检测，并基于AUROC指标选择最佳模型进行微调[paper:p0001]",\n        "conclusions": "ConvNeXt分类模型在SLC类型识别上达到100%准确率[paper:p0001]；最佳微调异常检测模型PatchCore的AUROC为0.811，DRAEM为0.748，表明SLC缺陷检测自动化仍有改进空间[paper:p0001]",\n        "contributions": "开发了模块化、成本效益高的相机门户，用于捕获SLC表面图像[paper:p0002]；创建了包含17,530张图像、34种SLC类型的标注数据集[paper:p0003]；证明了微调深度卷积神经网络可高精度分类SLC类型[paper:p0003]；比较了八种最先进异常检测方法，并识别出两个最有前景的候选方法[paper:p0003]；对候选模型进行了超参数调优和定量定性分析[paper:p0003]",\n        "limitations": ""\n      },\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.15439/2025f5518",\n      "title": "Real-time Container Tracking and Damage Detection at Seaports Using Deep Learning",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Sotiris Vasileiadis",\n        "Sheraz Aslam",\n        "Kyriacos Orphanides",\n        "Alessandro Cassera",\n        "Eduardo Garro",\n        "Alvaro Martınez-Romero",\n        "Michalis P. Michaelides",\n        "Herodotos Herodotou"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Annals of Computer Science and Information Systems",\n      "abstract": "Efficient container handling and early damage detection are critical for minimizing operational delays, reducing costs, and ensuring safety in global maritime logistics.This work presents a deep learning-based methodology for real-time container tracking and automated damage detection during crane unloading operations at container terminals.We develop and deploy two specialized YOLOv12-based object detection models: one for identifying containers in motion and another for detecting structural damages such as bents, dents, and holes.Our models are trained and evaluated on a real-world dataset curated from video feeds captured at the EUROGATE Container Terminal in Limassol, Cyprus.The system is designed for robust performance under realistic terminal conditions, including variable lighting and motion.Our models achieve high detection accuracy, with a mAP50 of 0.99 for container detectio...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习实现港口集装箱的实时跟踪与损伤检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "基于YOLOv12的目标检测模型",\n          "两个专用模型：一个用于运动中的集装箱识别，另一个用于结构损伤（如弯曲、凹痕、孔洞）检测"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "来自塞浦路斯利马索尔EUROGATE集装箱码头视频流的真实世界数据集"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种基于深度学习的实时集装箱跟踪与自动损伤检测方法",\n          "在真实码头条件下（包括可变光照和运动）实现了鲁棒性能",\n          "集装箱检测mAP50达到0.99，损伤检测mAP50达到0.75，显著优于现有基准"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "集装箱检测mAP50为0.99",\n          "损伤检测mAP50为0.75"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文提出了一种基于YOLOv12的深度学习框架，用于港口集装箱的实时跟踪与损伤检测，在真实码头数据集上取得了高精度，展示了提升自动化海运物流效率和安全的潜力。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 85,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文直接针对港口集装箱损伤检测这一用户主题，提出了基于YOLOv12的实时方法，并在真实数据集上取得了高精度结果，具有明确的应用价值和创新性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "indexed",\n      "extraction": {\n        "research_topic": "研究了基于深度学习的港口集装箱实时跟踪与损伤检测方法[paper:p0001]",\n        "research_object": "以塞浦路斯利马索尔EUROGATE集装箱码头2024年全年不同时段、不同天气条件下拍摄的IPTV视频数据为研究对象，包含1927张集装箱图像和732张损伤图像[paper:p0003]",\n        "methods": "采用YOLOv12模型，分别训练集装箱检测和损伤检测两个专用模型；使用BoT-SORT算法实现实时多目标跟踪；通过水平翻转和自定义损伤图像进行数据增强；采用超参数调优（IoU阈值、HSV饱和度、HSV亮度、图像分辨率）优化性能[paper:p0003][paper:p0004]",\n        "conclusions": "集装箱检测模型在测试集上达到mAP50为0.99、mAP50-95为0.93，仅8张图像误分类[paper:p0005]；损伤检测多类模型mAP50为0.69、mAP50-95为0.46，二类模型mAP50为0.79、mAP50-95为0.48[paper:p0006][paper:p0007]；系统在服务器上达到24 FPS，在Jetson AGX Orin上达到16 FPS，满足实时性要求[paper:p0007]",\n        "contributions": "提出了基于YOLOv12的集装箱实时跟踪与损伤检测系统，在真实港口环境下验证了有效性[paper:p0001]；构建了包含不同尺寸、类型、颜色集装箱以及孔洞、弯曲/凹陷、正常磨损三类损伤的真实数据集[paper:p0003]；实现了高精度集装箱检测（mAP50=0.99）和损伤检测（二类mAP50=0.79），显著优于现有基准[paper:p0001][paper:p0007]；设计了基于BoT-SORT的跟踪算法，解决了因外部遮挡导致的ID丢失问题[paper:p0004]",\n        "limitations": ""\n      },\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.1177/00368504251314084",\n      "title": "Automating container damage detection with the YOLO-NAS deep learning model",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Thanh Nguyen Thi Phuong",\n        "Gyu-Sung Cho",\n        "Indranath Chatterjee"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Science Progress",\n      "abstract": "Ensuring the integrity of shipping containers is crucial for maintaining product quality, logistics efficiency, and safety in the global supply chain. Damaged containers can lead to significant economic losses, delays, and safety hazards. Traditionally, container inspections have been manual, which are labor-intensive, time-consuming, and error-prone, especially in busy port environments. This study introduces an automated solution using the YOLO-NAS model, a cutting-edge deep learning architecture known for its adaptability, computational efficiency, and high accuracy in object detection tasks. Our research is among the first to apply YOLO-NAS to container damage detection, addressing the complex conditions of seaports and optimizing for high-speed, high-accuracy performance essential for port logistics. Our method showcases YOLO-NAS\'s superior efficacy in detecting container damage,...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用YOLO-NAS深度学习模型实现港口集装箱损伤的自动化检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "YOLO-NAS深度学习模型"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "首次将YOLO-NAS应用于集装箱损伤检测",\n          "实现了91.2%的平均精度（mAP）、92.4%的精确率和84.1%的召回率",\n          "与YOLOv8和Roboflow 3.0等模型相比，YOLO-NAS在类似条件下表现更优",\n          "为港口物流提供了实时、可靠的自动化检测方案，有助于减少人工检查、降低运营成本、提高安全性"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "YOLO-NAS在集装箱损伤检测中达到91.2%的mAP、92.4%的精确率和84.1%的召回率",\n          "YOLO-NAS在性能上优于YOLOv8和Roboflow 3.0",\n          "Fmask-RCNN和MobileNetV2虽训练精度高，但缺乏实时评估能力"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该研究提出使用YOLO-NAS深度学习模型自动化检测港口集装箱损伤，在复杂港口条件下实现了高精度和高速度，优于其他主流模型，为智能港口建设提供了有效方案。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 85,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文摘要明确提出了自动化检测方法、具体性能指标（mAP 91.2%等）和与多个模型的对比结果，且主题与用户需求高度相关，证据充分，值得深入阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "indexed",\n      "extraction": {\n        "research_topic": "",\n        "research_object": "",\n        "methods": "",\n        "conclusions": "",\n        "contributions": "",\n        "limitations": ""\n      },\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2109.11304v1",\n      "title": "Deep Learning Strategies for Industrial Surface Defect Detection Systems",\n      "year": 2021,\n      "authors": [\n        "Dominik Martin",\n        "Simon Heinzel",\n        "Johannes Kunze von Bischhoffshausen",\n        "Niklas Kühl"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Deep learning methods have proven to outperform traditional computer vision methods in various areas of image processing. However, the application of deep learning in industrial surface defect detection systems is challenging due to the insufficient amount of training data, the expensive data generation process, the small size, and the rare occurrence of surface defects. From literature and a polymer products manufacturing use case, we identify design requirements which reflect the aforementioned challenges. Addressing these, we conceptualize design principles and features informed by deep learning research. Finally, we instantiate and evaluate the gained design knowledge in the form of actionable guidelines and strategies based on an industrial surface defect detection use case. This article, therefore, contributes to academia as well as practice by (1) systematically identifying cha...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何应对深度学习在工业表面缺陷检测系统中面临的训练数据不足、数据生成成本高、缺陷尺寸小且罕见等挑战？",\n        "methods": [\n          "系统性地识别工业表面缺陷检测的挑战",\n          "基于深度学习研究提出设计原则和特征",\n          "通过工业表面缺陷检测用例实例化并评估设计知识，形成可操作的指南和策略",\n          "实验案例研究评估策略的适用性和有用性"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "聚合物产品制造用例"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "系统性地识别了深度学习在工业表面缺陷检测应用中的挑战",\n          "提出了克服这些挑战的策略",\n          "通过实验案例研究评估了策略的适用性和有用性"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "未明确提及具体局限性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "提出了可操作的指南和策略以应对工业表面缺陷检测中的挑战",\n          "实验案例研究验证了策略的适用性和有用性"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文针对深度学习在工业表面缺陷检测中面临的训练数据不足、数据生成成本高、缺陷小且罕见等挑战，通过文献和聚合物产品制造用例识别设计需求，提出设计原则和特征，并实例化为可操作的指南和策略，最后通过实验案例评估其有效性。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题‘港口集装箱损伤检测’高度相关，均涉及工业表面缺陷检测，且提出了系统性的挑战识别和策略，但摘要中缺乏具体数据集和性能指标，需要深入阅读以获取详细方法和结果。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2501.11836v1",\n      "title": "Data-driven Detection and Evaluation of Damages in Concrete Structures: Using Deep Learning and Computer Vision",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Saeid Ataei",\n        "Saeed Adibnazari",\n        "Seyyed Taghi Ataei"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Structural integrity is vital for maintaining the safety and longevity of concrete infrastructures such as bridges, tunnels, and walls. Traditional methods for detecting damages like cracks and spalls are labor-intensive, time-consuming, and prone to human error. To address these challenges, this study explores advanced data-driven techniques using deep learning for automated damage detection and analysis. Two state-of-the-art instance segmentation models, YOLO-v7 instance segmentation and Mask R-CNN, were evaluated using a dataset comprising 400 images, augmented to 10,995 images through geometric and color-based transformations to enhance robustness. The models were trained and validated using a dataset split into 90% training set, validation and test set 10%. Performance metrics such as precision, recall, mean average precision (mAP@0.5), and frames per second (FPS) were used for e...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用数据驱动的深度学习和计算机视觉技术自动检测和评估混凝土结构（如桥梁、隧道、墙体）中的损伤（如裂缝和剥落）？",\n        "methods": [\n          "YOLO-v7 instance segmentation",\n          "Mask R-CNN",\n          "几何和颜色变换数据增强"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "400张原始图像，通过数据增强扩展至10,995张图像"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "比较了YOLO-v7和Mask R-CNN在混凝土结构损伤检测中的性能",\n          "YOLO-v7在mAP@0.5（96.1%）和FPS（40）上优于Mask R-CNN（92.1% mAP@0.5，18 FPS）",\n          "推荐YOLO-v7用于实时高速结构健康监测，Mask R-CNN用于详细离线评估"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "数据集仅包含400张原始图像，可能不足以覆盖所有损伤类型和场景",\n          "未提及在港口集装箱场景下的适用性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "YOLO-v7的mAP@0.5为96.1%，处理速度为40 FPS",\n          "Mask R-CNN的mAP@0.5为92.1%，处理速度为18 FPS"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该研究利用YOLO-v7和Mask R-CNN两种实例分割模型，基于增强后的混凝土结构图像数据集进行损伤检测，结果显示YOLO-v7在精度和速度上均优于Mask R-CNN，适用于实时监测。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为混凝土结构损伤检测，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不完全匹配，且摘要中未提供港口集装箱相关证据，因此仅适合摘要阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2501.16662v2",\n      "title": "Vision-based autonomous structural damage detection using data-driven methods",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Seyyed Taghi Ataei",\n        "Parviz Mohammad Zadeh",\n        "Saeid Ataei"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "This study addresses the urgent need for efficient and accurate damage detection in wind turbine structures, a crucial component of renewable energy infrastructure. Traditional inspection methods, such as manual assessments and non-destructive testing (NDT), are often costly, time-consuming, and prone to human error. To tackle these challenges, this research investigates advanced deep learning algorithms for vision-based structural health monitoring (SHM). A dataset of wind turbine surface images, featuring various damage types and pollution, was prepared and augmented for enhanced model training. Three algorithms-YOLOv7, its lightweight variant, and Faster R-CNN- were employed to detect and classify surface damage. The models were trained and evaluated on a dataset split into training, testing, and evaluation subsets (80%-10%-10%). Results indicate that YOLOv7 outperformed the others...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用基于视觉的深度学习方法实现风力涡轮机结构的自主损伤检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "YOLOv7",\n          "YOLOv7轻量级变体",\n          "Faster R-CNN",\n          "数据增强",\n          "超参数优化（学习率、批量大小）"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "风力涡轮机表面图像数据集（包含多种损伤类型和污染）"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "研究了YOLOv7、其轻量级变体和Faster R-CNN三种算法在风力涡轮机表面损伤检测中的应用",\n          "通过超参数优化提升了模型的准确性和效率",\n          "展示了YOLOv7在实时检测中的优越性能（82.4% mAP@50和高处理速度）"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "数据集有限",\n          "环境变异性影响检测效果"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "YOLOv7在检测精度和执行速度上优于其他模型，适用于实时检测",\n          "YOLOv7达到82.4% mAP@50"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该研究针对风力涡轮机结构损伤检测的需求，采用YOLOv7、其轻量级变体和Faster R-CNN三种深度学习算法，基于增强后的表面图像数据集进行训练和评估。结果表明YOLOv7在精度和速度上表现最佳，适合实时检测，但存在数据集和环境变异性等局限。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为风力涡轮机结构损伤检测，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不完全匹配，但方法（基于视觉的深度学习）和任务（表面损伤检测）具有相关性。摘要提供了足够的方法和结果信息，但缺乏港口集装箱场景的具体验证，因此建议仅阅读摘要。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "s10489-024-05645-1",\n      "title": "Deep Learning for Computer Vision based Activity Recognition and Fall Detection of the Elderly: a Systematic Review",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "F. Xavier Gaya-Morey",\n        "Cristina Manresa-Yee",\n        "Jose M. Buades-Rubio"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "As the percentage of elderly people in developed countries increases worldwide, the healthcare of this collective is a worrying matter, especially if it includes the preservation of their autonomy. In this direction, many studies are being published on Ambient Assisted Living (AAL) systems, which help to reduce the preoccupations raised by the independent living of the elderly. In this study, a systematic review of the literature is presented on fall detection and Human Activity Recognition (HAR) for the elderly, as the two main tasks to solve to guarantee the safety of elderly people living alone. To address the current tendency to perform these two tasks, the review focuses on the use of Deep Learning (DL) based approaches on computer vision data. In addition, different collections of data like DL models, datasets or hardware (e.g. depth or thermal cameras) are gathered from the rev...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用基于深度学习的计算机视觉方法对老年人进行活动识别和跌倒检测？",\n        "methods": [],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [],\n        "short_summary": "该论文对基于深度学习的计算机视觉方法在老年人跌倒检测和人类活动识别（HAR）中的应用进行了系统性综述，收集了深度学习模型、数据集和硬件（如深度或热成像摄像头）等信息，讨论了现有方法的优缺点并提出了未来工作建议。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 0,\n        "decision": "insufficient",\n        "reason": "论文主题为老年人活动识别和跌倒检测，与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”不相关，因此无法提供有效信息。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/jimaging9100193",\n      "title": "A Systematic Review on Deep Learning with CNNs Applied to Surface Defect Detection",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "Esteban Cumbajin",\n        "Nuno Rodrigues",\n        "Paulo Manuel Costa",\n        "Rolando Miragaia",\n        "Luís Frazão",\n        "Nuno Costa",\n        "Antonio Fernández‐Caballero",\n        "Jorge Carneiro"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Journal of Imaging",\n      "abstract": "Surface defect detection with machine learning has become an important tool in industries and a large field of study for researchers or workers in recent years. It is necessary to have a simplified source of information that helps us to better focus on one type of surface. In this systematic review, we present a classification for surface defect detection based on convolutional neural networks (CNNs) focused on surface types. Findings: Out of 253 records identified, 59 primary studies were eligible. Following the Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses (PRISMA) guidelines, we analyzed the structures of each study and the concepts related to defects and their types on surfaces. The presented review is mainly focused on finding a classification for the types of surfaces most used in industry (metal, building, ceramic, wood, and special). We delve into the spec...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何基于卷积神经网络对表面缺陷检测进行系统分类，并分析不同表面类型（金属、建筑、陶瓷、木材、特殊）的检测方法、技术趋势和数据集特征？",\n        "methods": [\n          "系统综述遵循PRISMA指南",\n          "对59篇主要研究进行结构分析",\n          "提出基于机器学习的新分类法",\n          "分析表面类型、问题类型、时间线、网络类型、技术、数据集等特征"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "未明确列出具体数据集名称，但提及了数据集创建方法用于真实世界应用"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了基于表面类型的表面缺陷检测分类法",\n          "总结了金属、建筑、陶瓷、木材、特殊表面的应用实例",\n          "提供了快速高效的信息检索来源",\n          "分析了未来研究趋势"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "未明确列出局限性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "金属表面是最常用的表面类型，占62.71%的研究",\n          "分类是最普遍的问题类型，占49.15%",\n          "迁移学习在83.05%的研究中使用",\n          "数据增强在59.32%的研究中使用",\n          "提供了常用相机和照明挑战应对策略"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文是一篇系统综述，基于PRISMA指南对59篇关于卷积神经网络应用于表面缺陷检测的研究进行分析，提出了基于表面类型（金属、建筑、陶瓷、木材、特殊）的分类法，总结了各表面的应用实例、技术趋势和数据集特征，发现金属表面和分类问题最为常见，迁移学习和数据增强被广泛使用。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为表面缺陷检测的系统综述，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'相关但未具体聚焦于港口集装箱场景，摘要提供了足够的方法和结果信息，但缺乏针对港口集装箱的细节，因此建议仅阅读摘要。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/su15129314",\n      "title": "ROAD: Robotics-Assisted Onsite Data Collection and Deep Learning Enabled Robotic Vision System for Identification of Cracks on Diverse Surfaces",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "Renu Popli",\n        "Isha Kansal",\n        "Jyoti Verma",\n        "Vikas Khullar",\n        "Rajeev Kumar",\n        "Ashutosh Sharma"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Sustainability",\n      "abstract": "Crack detection on roads is essential nowadays because it has a significant impact on ensuring the safety and reliability of road infrastructure. Thus, it is necessary to create more effective and precise crack detection techniques. A safer road network and a better driving experience for all road users can result from the implementation of the ROAD (Robotics-Assisted Onsite Data Collecting) system for spotting road cracks using deep learning and robots. The suggested solution makes use of a robot vision system’s capabilities to gather high-quality data about the road and incorporates deep learning methods for automatically identifying cracks. Among the tested algorithms, Xception stands out as the most accurate and predictive model, with an accuracy of over 90% during the validation process and a mean square error of only 0.03. In contrast, other deep neural networks, such as DenseNe...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习和机器人技术实现道路裂缝的自动检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "ROAD (Robotics-Assisted Onsite Data Collection) 系统",\n          "机器人视觉系统",\n          "深度学习算法（Xception, DenseNet201, InceptionResNetV2, MobileNetV2, VGG16, VGG19）"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种结合机器人现场数据采集和深度学习的道路裂缝检测系统",\n          "验证了Xception模型在裂缝检测中的高准确率和低均方误差"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "Xception模型在验证过程中准确率超过90%，均方误差仅为0.03",\n          "Xception在准确率和召回率上表现优异，优于其他深度神经网络"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种名为ROAD的系统，利用机器人视觉和深度学习技术自动检测道路裂缝，其中Xception模型表现最佳，准确率超过90%。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 30,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为道路裂缝检测，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不直接相关，且摘要中未提供足够证据表明方法可迁移至集装箱场景。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2010.15303v1",\n      "title": "Automatic joint damage quantification using computer vision and deep learning",\n      "year": 2020,\n      "authors": [\n        "Quang Tran",\n        "Jeffery R. Roesler"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Joint raveled or spalled damage (henceforth called joint damage) can affect the safety and long-term performance of concrete pavements. It is important to assess and quantify the joint damage over time to assist in building action plans for maintenance, predicting maintenance costs, and maximize the concrete pavement service life. A framework for the accurate, autonomous, and rapid quantification of joint damage with a low-cost camera is proposed using a computer vision technique with a deep learning (DL) algorithm. The DL model is employed to train 263 images of sawcuts with joint damage. The trained DL model is used for pixel-wise color-masking joint damage in a series of query 2D images, which are used to reconstruct a 3D image using open-source structure from motion algorithm. Another damage quantification algorithm using a color threshold is applied to detect and compute the surf...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用计算机视觉和深度学习技术自动量化混凝土路面接缝损伤？",\n        "methods": [\n          "计算机视觉技术",\n          "深度学习算法",\n          "像素级颜色掩码",\n          "运动恢复结构算法",\n          "颜色阈值损伤量化算法"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "263张带接缝损伤的锯缝图像"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种利用低成本相机准确、自主、快速量化接缝损伤的框架",\n          "结合深度学习模型和3D重建技术实现损伤量化",\n          "通过实际接缝检测验证了框架的有效性"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "召回率为76%，误差为10%，性能仍有提升空间"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "框架在四个横向收缩缝的检测中实现了76%的召回率和10%的误差"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种结合计算机视觉和深度学习的框架，用于自动量化混凝土路面接缝损伤，通过训练263张图像并使用3D重建和颜色阈值算法，实现了76%的召回率和10%的误差。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不完全匹配，但涉及损伤检测的通用方法，摘要提供了足够信息，无需深入阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/s19030644",\n      "title": "An Automatic Surface Defect Inspection System for Automobiles Using Machine Vision Methods",\n      "year": 2019,\n      "authors": [\n        "Qinbang Zhou",\n        "Renwen Chen",\n        "Bin Huang",\n        "Chuan Liu",\n        "Jie Yu",\n        "Xiaoqing Yu"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Sensors",\n      "abstract": "Automobile surface defects like scratches or dents occur during the process of manufacturing and cross-border transportation. This will affect consumers\' first impression and the service life of the car itself. In most worldwide automobile industries, the inspection process is mainly performed by human vision, which is unstable and insufficient. The combination of artificial intelligence and the automobile industry shows promise nowadays. However, it is a challenge to inspect such defects in a computer system because of imbalanced illumination, specular highlight reflection, various reflection modes and limited defect features. This paper presents the design and implementation of a novel automatic inspection system (AIS) for automobile surface defects which are the located in or close to style lines, edges and handles. The system consists of image acquisition and image processing devi...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用机器视觉方法自动检测汽车表面缺陷（如划痕和凹痕）？",\n        "methods": [\n          "多尺度Hessian矩阵融合方法提取候选缺陷区域",\n          "特征提取（形状、大小、统计和散度特征）",\n          "支持向量机（SVM）分类器"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "未明确说明具体数据集，但使用了汽车车身图像进行实验"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "设计并实现了一种新型自动检测系统（AIS），用于检测位于风格线、边缘和把手附近或内部的汽车表面缺陷",\n          "系统采用封闭环境、非接触方式，配备四个LED光源和五个平面阵列CCD相机同步采集图像",\n          "实验表明系统能有效减少由图像噪声产生的伪缺陷误检，凹痕缺陷准确率达95.6%，划痕缺陷准确率达97.1%"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "未明确说明局限性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "凹痕缺陷检测准确率为95.6%",\n          "划痕缺陷检测准确率为97.1%",\n          "系统适用于进口车辆的海关检验"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于机器视觉的汽车表面缺陷自动检测系统，通过多尺度Hessian矩阵融合和SVM分类器，实现了对凹痕和划痕的高精度检测，准确率分别达到95.6%和97.1%。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 85,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”高度相关，均涉及表面缺陷检测，且方法（机器视觉、特征提取、分类器）具有可迁移性；摘要提供了明确的准确率结果，但缺乏数据集细节和局限性，需要深入阅读以评估方法对集装箱场景的适用性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "download_failed",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2506.22517v1",\n      "title": "Container damage detection using advanced computer vision model Yolov12 vs Yolov11 vs RF-DETR A comparative analysis",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Subhadip Kumar"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Containers are an integral part of the logistics industry and act as a barrier for cargo. A typical service life for a container is more than 20 years. However, overtime containers suffer various types of damage due to the mechanical as well as natural factors. A damaged container is a safety hazard for the employees handling it and a liability for the logistic company. Therefore, a timely inspection and detection of the damaged container is a key for prolonging service life as well as avoiding safety hazards. In this paper, we will compare the performance of the damage detection by three state-of-the-art advanced computer vision models Yolov12, Yolov11 and RF-DETR. We will use a dataset of 278 annotated images to train, validate and test the model. We will compare the mAP and precision of the model. The objective of this paper is to identify the model that is best suited for containe...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "比较三种先进计算机视觉模型（Yolov12、Yolov11和RF-DETR）在港口集装箱损伤检测中的性能，以确定最适合该任务的模型。",\n        "methods": [\n          "使用Yolov12、Yolov11和RF-DETR三种计算机视觉模型进行集装箱损伤检测",\n          "使用278张标注图像的数据集进行训练、验证和测试",\n          "比较模型的mAP和精确度指标"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "278张标注图像的数据集"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "对三种先进计算机视觉模型在集装箱损伤检测任务上进行了系统比较",\n          "发现Yolov11和Yolov12在mAP@50得分上优于RF-DETR（81.9% vs 77.7%）",\n          "发现RF-DETR在不常见损伤集装箱检测上表现更优，能高置信度准确检测损伤集装箱和损伤发生"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "Yolov11和Yolov12的mAP@50得分为81.9%，RF-DETR为77.7%",\n          "RF-DETR在不常见损伤集装箱检测上整体表现优于其他模型"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文比较了Yolov12、Yolov11和RF-DETR三种模型在港口集装箱损伤检测中的性能，使用278张标注图像的数据集。结果显示Yolov11和Yolov12在mAP@50上优于RF-DETR，但RF-DETR在不常见损伤集装箱检测上表现更优。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题高度相关，提供了具体的模型比较和性能指标，但摘要中缺少精确度数值和数据集细节，需要深入阅读全文获取完整信息。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "j.renene.2018.08.101",\n      "title": "New approach for solar tracking systems based on computer vision, low cost hardware and deep learning",\n      "year": 2018,\n      "authors": [\n        "Jose A. Carballo",\n        "Javier Bonilla",\n        "Manuel Berenguel",\n        "Jesús Fernández-Reche",\n        "Ginés García"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "In this work, a new approach for Sun tracking systems is presented. Due to the current system limitations regarding costs and operational problems, a new approach based on low cost, computer vision open hardware and deep learning has been developed. The preliminary tests carried out successfully in Plataforma solar de Almeria (PSA), reveal the great potential and show the new approach as a good alternative to traditional systems. The proposed approach can provide key variables for the Sun tracking system control like cloud movements prediction, block and shadow detection, atmospheric attenuation or measures of concentrated solar radiation, which can improve the control strategies of the system and therefore the system performance.",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何基于计算机视觉、低成本硬件和深度学习实现太阳跟踪系统的新方法",\n        "methods": [\n          "计算机视觉",\n          "低成本硬件",\n          "深度学习"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种基于计算机视觉、低成本硬件和深度学习的新型太阳跟踪方法",\n          "在Plataforma solar de Almeria (PSA)成功进行了初步测试，展示了巨大潜力",\n          "能够提供云运动预测、遮挡和阴影检测、大气衰减、聚光太阳辐射测量等关键变量，从而改进系统控制策略和性能"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "初步测试成功，表明新方法是传统系统的良好替代方案"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文提出了一种基于计算机视觉、低成本硬件和深度学习的新型太阳跟踪方法，在PSA的初步测试成功，显示出巨大潜力，并能提供多种关键变量以改进系统控制策略和性能。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 65,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不相关，且摘要信息有限，缺乏定量结果和具体细节，不适合深入阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2604.24193v1",\n      "title": "Computer Vision-Based Early Detection of Container Loss at Sea",\n      "year": 2026,\n      "authors": [\n        "Vishakha Lall",\n        "Capt. Stanley S Pinto",\n        "Capt. Chu Xing Peng",\n        "Wu Kaiwen"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Containerised shipping underpins global trade, yet container loss at sea remains a persistent safety, environmental, and economic challenge. Despite compliance with Cargo Securing Manuals, dynamic maritime conditions such as vessel motion, wind loading, and severe sea states can progressively destabilise container stacks, leading to overboard losses. With the new International Maritime Organisation\'s (IMO) mandatory reporting requirements for lost containers, there is an urgent need for a reliable, evidence-based early detection solution for destabilised containers. This study showcases a low-cost, retrofittable computer vision-based system for early detection of destabilised containers using existing onboard cameras. The framework integrates object segmentation to isolate container stacks, temporal object tracking using optical flow and individual objects\' residual motion extraction...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用计算机视觉技术实现海上集装箱丢失的早期检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "目标分割",\n          "光流法",\n          "个体目标残差运动提取"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "真实船上视频片段"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种低成本、可改装的基于计算机视觉的早期检测系统",\n          "利用现有船上摄像头实现集装箱失稳的早期检测",\n          "在多变海况和能见度条件下有效隔离集装箱级运动"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "所提出的流程在真实船上视频中有效隔离了集装箱级运动"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于计算机视觉的低成本系统，利用现有船上摄像头，通过目标分割、光流跟踪和残差运动提取，实现海上集装箱失稳的早期检测，并在真实船上视频中验证了有效性。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题高度相关，提出了具体的计算机视觉方法并进行了实验验证，但摘要中缺乏量化结果和局限性讨论，需要深入阅读全文以评估方法的实际性能和应用可行性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/su17146480",\n      "title": "Semantic Segmentation of Corrosion in Cargo Containers Using Deep Learning",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "David Ornelas",\n        "Daniel Canedo",\n        "António J. R. Neves"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Sustainability",\n      "abstract": "As global trade expands, the pressure on container terminals to improve efficiency and capacity grows. Several inspections are performed during the loading and unloading process to minimize delays. In this paper, we explore corrosion as it poses a persistent threat that compromises the durability of containers and leads to costly repairs. However, identifying this threat is no simple task. Corrosion can take many forms, progress unpredictably, and be influenced by various environmental conditions and container types. In collaboration with the Port of Sines, Portugal, this work explores a potential solution for a real-time computer-vision system, with the aim to improve container inspections using deep-learning algorithms. We propose a system based on the semantic segmentation model, DeepLabv3+, for precise corrosion detection using images provided from the terminal. After preparing th...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习语义分割模型实现港口集装箱腐蚀的自动检测",\n        "methods": [\n          "DeepLabv3+语义分割模型",\n          "迁移学习（预训练桥梁腐蚀检测模型）",\n          "微调（针对集装箱腐蚀检测的模型微调）"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "港口终端提供的集装箱图像（与葡萄牙锡尼什港合作）"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出基于DeepLabv3+的实时计算机视觉系统用于集装箱腐蚀检测",\n          "探索了迁移学习和微调两种方法在集装箱腐蚀检测中的应用",\n          "展示了深度学习在自动化集装箱检测中的潜力"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "腐蚀检测性能仅为49%",\n          "需要进一步改进泛化能力和真实场景训练"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "腐蚀检测性能达到49%"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文与葡萄牙锡尼什港合作，提出基于DeepLabv3+语义分割模型的实时计算机视觉系统，用于集装箱腐蚀检测。通过迁移学习和微调两种方法，实现了49%的腐蚀检测性能，展示了深度学习在自动化集装箱检测中的潜力，同时指出了泛化能力和真实场景训练的重要性。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 65,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题高度相关，聚焦于港口集装箱腐蚀检测，提出了具体方法并给出了性能指标，但性能较低且摘要信息有限，需要深入阅读以评估方法的细节和适用性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/asi7010011",\n      "title": "Deep Learning for Automated Visual Inspection in Manufacturing and Maintenance: A Survey of Open- Access Papers",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "Nils Hütten",\n        "Miguel Alves Gomes",\n        "Florian Hölken",\n        "Karlo Andricevic",\n        "Richard Meyes",\n        "Tobias Meisen"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Applied System Innovation",\n      "abstract": "Quality assessment in industrial applications is often carried out through visual inspection, usually performed or supported by human domain experts. However, the manual visual inspection of processes and products is error-prone and expensive. It is therefore not surprising that the automation of visual inspection in manufacturing and maintenance is heavily researched and discussed. The use of artificial intelligence as an approach to visual inspection in industrial applications has been considered for decades. Recent successes, driven by advances in deep learning, present a possible paradigm shift and have the potential to facilitate automated visual inspection, even under complex environmental conditions. For this reason, we explore the question of to what extent deep learning is already being used in the field of automated visual inspection and which potential improvements to the s...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "深度学习在制造与维护领域的自动化视觉检测中的应用程度及潜在改进方向",\n        "methods": [\n          "文献综述",\n          "卷积神经网络",\n          "视觉Transformer模型",\n          "监督学习",\n          "自监督学习"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "196篇开放获取出版物",\n          "中位数大小为2500样本的数据集"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提供了近年来提出的深度学习模型在自动化视觉检测中的概述",\n          "识别了学术研究与工业应用之间约三年的差距",\n          "指出了视觉Transformer模型在资源需求方面的优势与挑战"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "仅基于开放获取文献，可能遗漏非开放获取的重要研究",\n          "数据集规模较小（中位数2500样本），限制了模型从头训练的可能性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "31.7%为制造用例，68.3%为维护用例",\n          "大多数模型基于卷积神经网络",\n          "97%的出版物使用监督学习技术",\n          "视觉Transformer模型在性能上可能超越卷积神经网络但需要更多资源"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该综述调查了196篇开放获取文献，探讨深度学习在制造与维护自动化视觉检测中的应用，发现卷积神经网络仍为主流，但视觉Transformer模型正在兴起，且存在学术与工业应用之间的时间差距。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 85,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题‘港口集装箱损伤检测’高度相关，提供了深度学习在视觉检测中的全面综述，包括方法、数据集和未来方向，对理解该领域现状和潜在技术有重要参考价值。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "download_failed",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.1002/eng2.12852",\n      "title": "Autopilot control unmanned aerial vehicle system for sewage defect detection using deep learning",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "Binay Kumar Pandey",\n        "Digvijay Pandey",\n        "Kameshwar Sahani"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Engineering Reports",\n      "abstract": "Abstract This work proposes the use of an unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) with an autopilot to identify the defects present in municipal sewerage pipes. The framework also includes an effective autopilot control mechanism that can direct the flight path of a UAV within a sewer line. Both of these breakthroughs have been addressed throughout this work. The UAV\'s camera proved useful throughout a sewage inspection, providing important contextual data that helped analyze the sewerage line\'s internal condition. A plethora of information useful for understanding the sewerage line\'s inner functioning and extracting interior visual details can be obtained from camera‐recorded sewerage imagery if a defect is present. In the case of sewerage inspections, nevertheless, the impact of a false negative is significantly higher than that of a false positive. One of the trickiest parts of the procedure...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用无人机和深度学习技术检测城市污水管道中的缺陷？",\n        "methods": [\n          "引导图像滤波（GIF）",\n          "Gabor变换（GT）",\n          "笔画宽度变换（SWT）",\n          "加权朴素贝叶斯分类器（WNBC）",\n          "加速鲁棒特征（SURF）",\n          "深度学习"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "无人机拍摄的污水管道图像"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种带有自动驾驶仪的无人机系统用于污水管道缺陷检测",\n          "实现了有效的自动驾驶控制机制以引导无人机在污水管道内的飞行路径",\n          "通过引导图像滤波减少了假阴性和假阳性结果",\n          "结合多种特征提取和分类方法提高了检测性能"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "论文未明确说明数据集的具体规模和来源",\n          "未讨论不同环境条件下的泛化能力",\n          "未提及计算资源需求或实时性限制"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "平均PSNR为71.854",\n          "平均MSE为0.0618",\n          "平均RMSE为0.2485",\n          "平均SSIM为98.71%",\n          "平均准确率为98.372%",\n          "平均特异性为97.837%",\n          "平均精确率为93.296%",\n          "平均召回率为94.255%"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于自动驾驶无人机和深度学习的污水管道缺陷检测系统，通过图像预处理、特征提取和分类方法实现了高准确率的缺陷识别。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”不直接相关，但方法（无人机、深度学习、图像处理）可能具有借鉴意义，摘要提供了足够信息判断相关性不足，无需深入阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/app14167116",\n      "title": "Historic Built Environment Assessment and Management by Deep Learning Techniques: A Scoping Review",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "Valeria Giannuzzi",\n        "Fabio Fatiguso"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Applied Sciences",\n      "abstract": "Recent advancements in digital technologies and automated analysis techniques applied to Historic Built Environment (HBE) demonstrate significant advantages in efficiently collecting and interpreting data for building conservation activities. Integrating digital image processing through Artificial Intelligence approaches further streamlines data analysis for diagnostic assessments. In this context, this paper presents a scoping review based on Scopus and Web of Science databases, following the PRISMA protocol, focusing on applying Deep Learning (DL) architectures for image-based classification of decay phenomena in the HBE, aiming to explore potential implementations in decision support system. From the literature screening process, 29 selected articles were analyzed according to methods for identifying buildings’ surface deterioration, cracks, and post-disaster damage at a district s...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "深度学习技术在历史建筑环境评估与管理中的应用现状与潜力",\n        "methods": [\n          "PRISMA协议",\n          "Scopus和Web of Science数据库文献筛选",\n          "深度学习架构（用于图像分类）",\n          "数字图像处理",\n          "人工智能方法"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "29篇选定文章"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "系统综述了深度学习在历史建筑环境表面退化、裂缝和灾后损伤识别中的应用",\n          "评估了数据采集和实时监测的方法与工具",\n          "强调了在互操作环境中实施技术以促进利益相关者信息共享的优势"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "仅基于Scopus和Web of Science数据库",\n          "文献筛选数量有限（29篇）"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "深度学习方法在历史建筑遗产保护诊断中具有潜力",\n          "当前研究趋势集中在表面退化、裂缝和灾后损伤分类"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文基于PRISMA协议对Scopus和Web of Science数据库进行范围综述，分析了29篇关于深度学习在历史建筑环境图像分类中应用的文章，探讨了其在决策支持系统中的潜力，并指出了未来挑战包括移动应用、传感器和物联网集成等。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为历史建筑环境评估，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不直接相关，但深度学习在损伤检测中的应用方法可能具有参考价值，因此仅需阅读摘要即可。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/s25030664",\n      "title": "Aluminum Reservoir Welding Surface Defect Detection Method Based on Three-Dimensional Vision",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Hanjie Huang",\n        "Bin Zhou",\n        "Songxiao Cao",\n        "Tao Song",\n        "Zhipeng Xu",\n        "Qing Jiang"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Sensors",\n      "abstract": "Welding is an important process in the production of aluminum reservoirs for motor vehicles. The welding quality affects product performance. However, rapid and accurate detection of weld surface defects remains a huge challenge in the field of industrial automation. To address this problem, we proposed a 3D vision-based aluminum reservoir welding surface defect detection method. First of all, a scanning system based on laser line scanning camera was constructed to acquire the point cloud data of weld seams on the aluminum reservoir surface. Next, a planar correction algorithm was used to adjust the slope of the contour line according to the slope of the contour line in order to minimize the effect of systematic disturbances when acquiring weld data. Then, the surface features of the weld, including curvature and normal vector direction, were extracted to extract holes, craters, and u...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何基于三维视觉快速准确地检测铝制储罐焊接表面缺陷？",\n        "methods": [\n          "基于激光线扫描相机构建扫描系统获取点云数据",\n          "平面校正算法调整轮廓线斜率以减小系统扰动",\n          "提取焊缝表面曲率和法向量方向特征以检测孔洞、凹坑和咬边缺陷",\n          "双对齐模板匹配方法确保缺陷区域的全面提取和测量",\n          "根据形态对检测到的缺陷进行分类"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "铝制储罐焊缝表面点云数据（由激光线扫描系统采集）"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种基于三维视觉的铝制储罐焊接表面缺陷检测方法",\n          "实现了对孔洞、咬边和凹坑等典型焊接缺陷的检测与分类",\n          "检测精度超过97.1%，不同缺陷类型的检测精度达到98.9%"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "所提方法使用3D激光扫描数据检测和分类典型焊接缺陷的准确率超过97.1%",\n          "孔洞、咬边和凹坑等不同类型缺陷的检测精度达到98.9%"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文提出了一种基于三维视觉的铝制储罐焊接表面缺陷检测方法，通过激光线扫描获取点云数据，结合平面校正、特征提取和双对齐模板匹配，实现了对孔洞、凹坑和咬边缺陷的高精度检测与分类，准确率超过97.1%。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 85,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'高度相关，均涉及工业表面缺陷检测，且方法基于三维视觉，具有较高的技术参考价值。摘要提供了明确的方法、数据集和量化结果，证据充分，建议深入阅读以评估方法在集装箱场景的适用性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "download_failed",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/s24206733",\n      "title": "An Adaptive Parameter Optimization Deep Learning Model for Energetic Liquid Vision Recognition Based on Feedback Mechanism",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "Lu Chen",\n        "Yuhao Yang",\n        "Tianci Wu",\n        "Chiang Liu",\n        "Yang Li",\n        "Jie Tan",\n        "Weizhong Qian",\n        "Liang Huai Yang"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Sensors",\n      "abstract": "The precise detection of liquid flow and viscosity is a crucial challenge in industrial processes and environmental monitoring due to the variety of liquid samples and the complex reflective properties of energetic liquids. Traditional methods often struggle to maintain accuracy under such conditions. This study addresses the complexity arising from sample diversity and the reflective properties of energetic liquids by introducing a novel model based on computer vision and deep learning. We propose the DBN-AGS-FLSS, an integrated deep learning model for high-precision, real-time liquid surface pointer detection. The model combines Deep Belief Networks (DBN), Feedback Least-Squares SVM classifiers (FLSS), and Adaptive Genetic Selectors (AGS). Enhanced by bilateral filtering and adaptive contrast enhancement algorithms, the model significantly improves image clarity and detection accura...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习和计算机视觉技术，实现对含能液体（如港口集装箱中可能存在的危险液体）的高精度、实时检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "DBN-AGS-FLSS集成模型",\n          "Deep Belief Networks (DBN)",\n          "Feedback Least-Squares SVM classifiers (FLSS)",\n          "Adaptive Genetic Selectors (AGS)",\n          "双边滤波",\n          "自适应对比度增强算法",\n          "反馈机制用于反向判断和动态优化参数"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种基于计算机视觉和深度学习的新型模型DBN-AGS-FLSS，用于高精度、实时的液体表面指针检测",\n          "通过双边滤波和自适应对比度增强算法显著提高了图像清晰度和检测精度",\n          "利用反馈机制动态优化模型参数，增强了系统的准确性和鲁棒性",\n          "在多种复杂检测场景下验证了模型的优越性能，为工业实时监控和自动化系统提供了新途径"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "准确率99.37%",\n          "精确率99.36%",\n          "F1分数99.16%",\n          "召回率99.36%",\n          "推理速度仅1.5毫秒/帧"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于深度学习和计算机视觉的DBN-AGS-FLSS模型，用于含能液体的高精度实时检测，通过双边滤波、自适应对比度增强和反馈机制优化参数，在多个复杂场景下取得了99%以上的准确率和极快的推理速度。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题‘港口集装箱损伤检测’不完全匹配（聚焦于液体检测而非集装箱损伤），但含能液体检测与港口危险品监控高度相关，且方法具有通用性；摘要提供了充分的性能指标和模型细节，但缺少数据集和局限性信息，需要进一步阅读全文以评估其适用性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/app13042575",\n      "title": "Deep Learning for Estimating the Fill-Level of Industrial Waste Containers of Metal Scrap: A Case Study of a Copper Tube Plant",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "Kosmas Alexopoulos",\n        "Paolo Catti",\n        "Giannis Kanellopoulos",\n        "Nikolaos Nikolakis",\n        "Athanasios Blatsiotis",\n        "K. Christodoulopoulos",\n        "Apostolos Kaimenopoulos",\n        "Efstathia Ziata"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Applied Sciences",\n      "abstract": "Advanced digital solutions are increasingly introduced into manufacturing systems to make them more intelligent. Intelligent Waste Management Systems in industries allow for data collection and analysis to make better-informed decisions, monitor and manage processes remotely, and improve waste management. In many industries, scrap is collected in large waste containers located on the factory floor, usually close to its source. In most cases, monitoring of waste containers’ fill levels is either manually performed by visual inspection by the operators working in close proximity or by employing intrusive mechanical systems such as weight sensors. This work presents a computer vision system that uses Deep Learning (DL) and Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) for the automated estimation of the fill level in industrial waste containers of metal scrap. The training method and parameters as...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习自动估计工业金属废料容器的填充水平？",\n        "methods": [\n          "计算机视觉系统",\n          "深度学习（DL）",\n          "卷积神经网络（CNN）",\n          "VGG16模型",\n          "迁移学习（重新训练VGG16）"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "现场采集的工业废料容器图像：第一个容器9772张图像，第二个容器11234张图像"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种基于深度学习的计算机视觉系统，用于自动估计金属废料容器的填充水平",\n          "在铜管生产行业的实际案例中验证了方法的有效性",\n          "展示了VGG16模型在测试数据集上达到77.5%至95%的准确率"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "论文未明确说明局限性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "VGG16模型在测试数据集上的准确率为77.5%至95%",\n          "该系统具有足够的精度用于金属废料容器填充水平的分类"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于深度学习（VGG16 CNN）的计算机视觉系统，用于自动估计工业金属废料容器的填充水平，并在铜管生产行业的实际案例中验证了其有效性，测试准确率达到77.5%至95%。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 10,\n        "decision": "insufficient",\n        "reason": "论文主题为工业金属废料容器填充水平估计，与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”不相关，缺乏直接证据支持用户需求。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.1016/j.watres.2023.119632",\n      "title": "Deep learning for detecting macroplastic litter in water bodies: A review",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "Tianlong Jia",\n        "Zoran Kapelan",\n        "Rinze de Vries",\n        "Paul Vriend",\n        "Eric Copius Peereboom",\n        "Imke Okkerman",\n        "Riccardo Taormina"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Water Research",\n      "abstract": "Plastic pollution in water bodies is an unresolved environmental issue that damages all aquatic environments, and causes economic and health problems. Accurate detection of macroplastic litter (plastic items >5 mm) in water is essential to estimate the quantities, compositions and sources, identify emerging trends, and design preventive measures or mitigation strategies. In recent years, researchers have demonstrated the potential of computer vision (CV) techniques based on deep learning (DL) for automated detection of macroplastic litter in water bodies. However, a systematic review to describe the state-of-the-art of the field is lacking. Here we provide such a review, and we highlight current knowledge gaps and suggest promising future research directions. The review compares 34 papers with respect to their application and modeling related criteria. The results show that the resear...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习技术自动检测水体中的大塑料垃圾（>5mm）？",\n        "methods": [\n          "计算机视觉（CV）技术",\n          "深度学习（DL）架构"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "系统综述了34篇论文，描述了该领域的研究现状",\n          "指出了当前的知识空白，包括缺乏足够泛化能力的DL检测模型、缺乏基于DL的塑料质量通量和热点量化方法、以及缺乏可扩展的监测策略",\n          "提出了未来研究方向，如数据驱动的人工智能方法和半监督学习"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "缺乏具有足够泛化能力的DL检测模型",\n          "缺乏基于DL的塑料质量通量和热点量化方法",\n          "缺乏可扩展的监测策略"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "研究人员已采用多种DL架构和CV技术来检测不同水生环境中的大塑料垃圾",\n          "存在关键知识空白需要解决"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文系统综述了深度学习在水体大塑料垃圾检测中的应用，比较了34篇论文，指出了当前知识空白并提出了未来研究方向。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为水体塑料垃圾检测，与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”不直接相关，但深度学习检测方法可能具有参考价值，因此建议仅阅读摘要。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.32604/cmes.2023.028018",\n      "title": "Exploring Deep Learning Methods for Computer Vision Applications across Multiple Sectors: Challenges and Future Trends",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "N. Ganesh",\n        "Rajendran Shankar",\n        "Miroslav Mahdal",\n        "Janakiraman Senthil Murugan",\n        "Jasgurpreet Singh Chohan",\n        "Kanak Kalita"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Computer Modeling in Engineering & Sciences",\n      "abstract": "Computer vision (CV) was developed for computers and other systems to act or make recommendations based on visual inputs, such as digital photos, movies, and other media. Deep learning (DL) methods are more successful than other traditional machine learning (ML) methods in CV. DL techniques can produce state-of-the-art results for difficult CV problems like picture categorization, object detection, and face recognition. In this review, a structured discussion on the history, methods, and applications of DL methods to CV problems is presented. The sector-wise presentation of applications in this paper may be particularly useful for researchers in niche fields who have limited or introductory knowledge of DL methods and CV. This review will provide readers with context and examples of how these techniques can be applied to specific areas. A curated list of popular datasets and a brief d...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "探索深度学习方法在计算机视觉中的应用，涵盖多个领域，包括港口集装箱损伤检测",\n        "methods": [\n          "深度学习（DL）方法",\n          "传统机器学习（ML）方法"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "流行数据集（未具体列出）"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "结构化讨论深度学习在计算机视觉中的历史、方法和应用",\n          "按领域展示应用，有助于小众领域研究者",\n          "提供流行数据集列表及简要描述"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "深度学习方法在图像分类、目标检测、人脸识别等计算机视觉问题上取得最先进结果"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该综述论文系统讨论了深度学习在计算机视觉中的历史、方法和应用，按领域展示应用，并提供流行数据集列表，但未专门聚焦港口集装箱损伤检测。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 30,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文为综述，未专门针对港口集装箱损伤检测，缺乏具体方法和结果，仅适合作为背景参考。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.1155/2022/4820618",\n      "title": "Surface Quality Automatic Inspection for Pharmaceutical Capsules Using Deep Learning",\n      "year": 2022,\n      "authors": [\n        "Hao Dong",\n        "Jing Yang",\n        "Jun Wang",\n        "Shaobo Li"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Journal of Sensors",\n      "abstract": "Capsules are commonly used as containers for most pharmaceutical products. Thus, the quality of a capsule is closely related to the therapeutic effect of the products and patient health. At present, surface quality testing is an essential task in the actual production of pharmaceutical capsules. In this study, a deep learning-based capsule defect detection model, called CapsuleDet, is proposed to classify and localize defects in image sensor data from capsule production for practical application. A guided filter-based image enhancement method and hybrid data augmentation method are used in improving the quality and quantity of the raw data, respectively, to mitigate the low contrast issue and enhance the robustness of the model training. Deformable convolution module and attentional fusion feature pyramid are also used to improve the detection effect of capsule defects by effectively...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习实现药品胶囊表面质量的自动检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "基于引导滤波的图像增强方法",\n          "混合数据增强方法",\n          "可变形卷积模块",\n          "注意力融合特征金字塔"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "胶囊缺陷数据集"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了名为CapsuleDet的胶囊缺陷检测模型",\n          "使用引导滤波和混合数据增强改善数据质量和数量",\n          "利用可变形卷积和注意力融合特征金字塔提升不同形状和尺度缺陷的检测效果"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "平均精度均值达到92.91%",\n          "检测速度为22.16帧每秒",\n          "在训练时间、模型大小、检测精度和速度方面优于当前流行检测器"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于深度学习的胶囊缺陷检测模型CapsuleDet，通过图像增强、数据增强、可变形卷积和注意力融合特征金字塔等技术，在胶囊缺陷数据集上实现了92.91%的平均精度和22.16帧每秒的检测速度，整体性能优于现有流行检测器。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 85,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文摘要提供了清晰的研究问题、方法、数据集、结果和贡献，但用户主题是港口集装箱损伤检测，与论文主题（药品胶囊表面质量检测）不直接相关，因此无需深入阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2005.06089v1",\n      "title": "Apple Defect Detection Using Deep Learning Based Object Detection For Better Post Harvest Handling",\n      "year": 2020,\n      "authors": [\n        "Paolo Valdez"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "The inclusion of Computer Vision and Deep Learning technologies in Agriculture aims to increase the harvest quality, and productivity of farmers. During postharvest, the export market and quality evaluation are affected by assorting of fruits and vegetables. In particular, apples are susceptible to a wide range of defects that can occur during harvesting or/and during the post-harvesting period. This paper aims to help farmers with post-harvest handling by exploring if recent computer vision and deep learning methods such as the YOLOv3 (Redmon & Farhadi (2018)) can help in detecting healthy apples from apples with defects.",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习方法检测苹果缺陷以改善采后处理",\n        "methods": [\n          "YOLOv3"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "探索YOLOv3在苹果缺陷检测中的应用，帮助农民区分健康苹果和有缺陷苹果"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [],\n        "short_summary": "该论文研究使用YOLOv3深度学习目标检测方法检测苹果缺陷，以改善采后处理，帮助农民区分健康苹果和有缺陷苹果。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 30,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为苹果缺陷检测，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不相关，且摘要信息有限，缺乏具体方法和结果。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.59543/comdem.v2i.14391",\n      "title": "Enhancing Glass Defect Detection with Diffusion Models: Addressing Imbalanced Datasets in Manufacturing Quality Control",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Sajjad Rezvani Boroujeni",\n        "Hossein Abedi",\n        "Tom Bush"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Computer and decision making.",\n      "abstract": "Visual defect detection in industrial glass manufacturing remains a critical challenge due to the low frequency of defective products, leading to imbalanced datasets that limit the performance of deep learning models and computer vision systems. This paper presents a novel approach using Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models (DDPMs) to generate synthetic defective glass product images for data augmentation, effectively addressing class imbalance issues in manufacturing quality control and automated visual inspection. The methodology significantly enhances image classification performance of standard CNN architectures (ResNet50V2, EfficientNetB0, and MobileNetV2) in detecting anomalies by increasing the minority class representation. Experimental results demonstrate substantial improvements in key machine learning metrics, particularly in recall for defective samples across all test...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何解决工业玻璃制造中因缺陷产品频率低导致的数据集不平衡问题，以提升深度学习模型在视觉缺陷检测中的性能？",\n        "methods": [\n          "使用去噪扩散概率模型（DDPMs）生成合成缺陷玻璃产品图像进行数据增强"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "玻璃制造缺陷图像数据集（具体名称未在摘要中明确）"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种使用DDPMs生成合成缺陷图像以解决类不平衡问题的新方法",\n          "显著提升了标准CNN架构（ResNet50V2、EfficientNetB0、MobileNetV2）在缺陷检测中的图像分类性能",\n          "在保持完美精确度的同时，大幅提高了缺陷样本的召回率",\n          "ResNet50V2的整体分类准确率从78%提升至93%"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "摘要未明确讨论方法的局限性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "ResNet50V2的整体分类准确率从78%提升至93%",\n          "所有测试的深度神经网络架构在缺陷样本召回率上均有显著提升",\n          "保持了完美的精确度"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出使用去噪扩散概率模型（DDPMs）生成合成缺陷玻璃产品图像进行数据增强，以解决工业玻璃制造中因缺陷产品频率低导致的数据集不平衡问题。实验表明，该方法显著提升了标准CNN架构在缺陷检测中的分类性能，尤其是ResNet50V2的准确率从78%提升至93%，同时保持了完美的精确度。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 85,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'高度相关，均涉及工业视觉缺陷检测和类不平衡问题。摘要提供了明确的方法（DDPMs数据增强）和显著的结果（准确率提升至93%），但缺乏具体数据集细节和局限性讨论，需要深入阅读以评估方法在港口集装箱场景的适用性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "indexed",\n      "extraction": {\n        "research_topic": "研究利用扩散模型（DDPM）生成合成缺陷玻璃产品图像以进行数据增强，从而解决制造质量控制中数据集不平衡的问题[paper:p0001]",\n        "research_object": "玻璃容器制造中的缺陷检测任务，使用MVTec异常检测数据集中的玻璃瓶图像（209张非缺陷图像和63张缺陷图像）[paper:p0005]",\n        "methods": "使用去噪扩散概率模型（DDPM）生成合成缺陷图像进行数据增强，然后训练三种CNN架构（ResNet50V2、EfficientNetB0、MobileNetV2）进行缺陷分类[paper:p0001][paper:p0002]",\n        "conclusions": "集成DDPM生成的合成缺陷图像显著提升了所有测试CNN架构的性能，其中ResNet50V2的整体分类准确率从78%提升至93%[paper:p0001]。召回率（正确识别真实缺陷的能力）在EfficientNetB0上从35%提升至65%，MobileNetV2上从60%提升至67%，ResNet50V2上从80%提升至84%，同时保持了完美的精确率[paper:p0002]",\n        "contributions": "(i) 新颖的DDPM应用：展示了扩散模型生成高保真玻璃缺陷图像，有效补充不平衡的制造数据集[paper:p0002]；(ii) 全面的模型评估：系统分析了合成数据增强如何影响三种不同CNN架构在玻璃缺陷检测中的性能[paper:p0002]；(iii) 改进的少数类检测：显著提升了缺陷检测的召回率和F1分数，同时保持零假阳性[paper:p0002]",\n        "limitations": ""\n      },\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/info15040239",\n      "title": "Deep Learning-Based Road Pavement Inspection by Integrating Visual Information and IMU",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "Chen-Chiung Hsieh",\n        "Han-Wen Jia",\n        "Wei-Hsin Huang",\n        "Mei-Hua Hsih"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Information",\n      "abstract": "This study proposes a deep learning method for pavement defect detection, focusing on identifying potholes and cracks. A dataset comprising 10,828 images is collected, with 8662 allocated for training, 1083 for validation, and 1083 for testing. Vehicle attitude data are categorized based on three-axis acceleration and attitude change, with 6656 (64%) for training, 1664 (16%) for validation, and 2080 (20%) for testing. The Nvidia Jetson Nano serves as the vehicle-embedded system, transmitting IMU-acquired vehicle data and GoPro-captured images over a 5G network to the server. The server recognizes two damage categories, low-risk and high-risk, storing results in MongoDB. Severe damage triggers immediate alerts to maintenance personnel, while less severe issues are recorded for scheduled maintenance. The method selects YOLOv7 among various object detection models for pavement defect det...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习方法结合视觉信息和IMU数据进行道路路面损伤检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "YOLOv7",\n          "Bi-LSTM",\n          "5G网络传输",\n          "Nvidia Jetson Nano嵌入式系统",\n          "MongoDB存储"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "10,828张路面图像（8662训练，1083验证，1083测试）",\n          "6656条车辆姿态数据（训练），1664条（验证），2080条（测试）"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种结合视觉信息和IMU数据的深度学习路面损伤检测方法",\n          "实现了低风险和高风险损伤分类，并触发即时警报或记录维护",\n          "在实地测试中达到90.2%召回率和83.7%精确率"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "未提及在港口集装箱损伤检测场景下的适用性",\n          "未讨论不同光照、天气条件下的鲁棒性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "YOLOv7在路面缺陷检测中达到93.3% mAP、87.8%召回率、93.2%精确率、30-40 FPS",\n          "Bi-LSTM在车辆振动数据处理中达到77% mAP、94.9%召回率、89.8%精确率",\n          "集成视觉和振动结果后，实地测试召回率90.2%、精确率83.7%"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于深度学习的路面损伤检测方法，结合视觉图像和IMU数据，使用YOLOv7和Bi-LSTM模型，通过5G网络传输数据，实现低风险和高风险损伤分类，并在实地测试中取得了较好的性能。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 30,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为道路路面损伤检测，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不直接相关，且摘要中未提及集装箱或港口场景，因此仅适合摘要阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/a16020095",\n      "title": "Defect Detection Methods for Industrial Products Using Deep Learning Techniques: A Review",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "Alireza Saberironaghi",\n        "Jing Ren",\n        "Moustafa El–Gindy"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Algorithms",\n      "abstract": "Over the last few decades, detecting surface defects has attracted significant attention as a challenging task. There are specific classes of problems that can be solved using traditional image processing techniques. However, these techniques struggle with complex textures in backgrounds, noise, and differences in lighting conditions. As a solution to this problem, deep learning has recently emerged, motivated by two main factors: accessibility to computing power and the rapid digitization of society, which enables the creation of large databases of labeled samples. This review paper aims to briefly summarize and analyze the current state of research on detecting defects using machine learning methods. First, deep learning-based detection of surface defects on industrial products is discussed from three perspectives: supervised, semi-supervised, and unsupervised. Secondly, the current...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习方法检测工业产品表面缺陷？",\n        "methods": [\n          "监督学习",\n          "半监督学习",\n          "无监督学习",\n          "基于深度学习的X射线图像缺陷检测方法"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "从监督、半监督和无监督三个视角综述了基于深度学习的工业产品表面缺陷检测方法",\n          "讨论了X射线图像中深度学习缺陷检测方法的研究现状",\n          "总结了表面缺陷检测中常见的挑战及其潜在解决方案"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "传统图像处理技术难以处理复杂纹理背景、噪声和光照差异"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [],\n        "short_summary": "该综述论文总结了利用深度学习方法检测工业产品表面缺陷的研究现状，涵盖监督、半监督和无监督方法，并讨论了X射线图像缺陷检测及常见挑战与解决方案。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 60,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文为综述，未提供具体实验数据集和定量结果，且用户主题为港口集装箱损伤检测，论文仅涉及一般工业产品表面缺陷，未明确针对港口集装箱场景。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "1908.02548v1",\n      "title": "Automated Corrosion Detection Using Crowd Sourced Training for Deep Learning",\n      "year": 2019,\n      "authors": [\n        "W. T. Nash",\n        "C. J. Powell",\n        "T. Drummond",\n        "N. Birbilis"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "The automated detection of corrosion from images (i.e., photographs) or video (i.e., drone footage) presents significant advantages in terms of corrosion monitoring. Such advantages include access to remote locations, mitigation of risk to inspectors, cost savings and monitoring speed. The automated detection of corrosion requires deep learning to approach human level artificial intelligence (A.I.). The training of a deep learning model requires intensive image labelling, and in order to generate a large database of labelled images, crowd sourced labelling via a dedicated website was sought. The website (corrosiondetector.com) permits any user to label images, with such labelling then contributing to the training of a cloud based A.I. model - with such a cloud-based model then capable of assessing any fresh (or uploaded) image for the presence of corrosion. In other words, the website...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用众包标注训练深度学习模型实现自动化腐蚀检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "众包标注",\n          "深度学习模型训练",\n          "基于云的AI模型"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "通过网站(corrosiondetector.com)众包标注的图像数据集"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种利用众包标注训练深度学习模型进行自动化腐蚀检测的方法",\n          "开发了包含众包训练和模型应用的网站(corrosiondetector.com)"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "仅报告了约一个月内的结果和发现"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "网站(corrosiondetector.com)在约一个月内实现了众包标注和模型应用"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种利用众包标注训练深度学习模型进行自动化腐蚀检测的方法，并开发了包含众包训练和模型应用的网站，报告了约一个月内的结果和发现。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 55,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "摘要提供了方法框架和初步结果，但缺乏具体性能指标、数据集规模和模型细节，不足以支持深入阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2409.14289v3",\n      "title": "Deep Learning Technology for Face Forgery Detection: A Survey",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "Lixia Ma",\n        "Puning Yang",\n        "Yuting Xu",\n        "Ziming Yang",\n        "Peipei Li",\n        "Huaibo Huang"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Currently, the rapid development of computer vision and deep learning has enabled the creation or manipulation of high-fidelity facial images and videos via deep generative approaches. This technology, also known as deepfake, has achieved dramatic progress and become increasingly popular in social media. However, the technology can generate threats to personal privacy and national security by spreading misinformation. To diminish the risks of deepfake, it is desirable to develop powerful forgery detection methods to distinguish fake faces from real faces. This paper presents a comprehensive survey of recent deep learning-based approaches for facial forgery detection. We attempt to provide the reader with a deeper understanding of the current advances as well as the major challenges for deepfake detection based on deep learning. We present an overview of deepfake techniques and analyse...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习技术进行人脸伪造检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "综述了基于深度学习的人脸伪造检测方法"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "分析了各种深度伪造数据集的特征"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提供了对当前深度学习人脸伪造检测进展的深入理解",\n          "系统回顾了不同类别的深度伪造检测方法和最新技术",\n          "分析了现有检测方法的缺点并讨论了未来研究方向"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "现有检测方法的性能不足",\n          "泛化能力有待提高"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "未提供具体实验结果"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文综述了基于深度学习的人脸伪造检测方法，包括深度伪造技术概述、数据集分析、检测方法分类与回顾，以及现有方法的局限性和未来研究方向。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 30,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为人脸伪造检测，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不相关，且摘要中未提供具体实验结果，仅适合阅读摘要。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.1007/s44163-023-00069-1",\n      "title": "Image-based and risk-informed detection of Subsea Pipeline damage",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "Rialda Spahić",\n        "Kameshwar Poolla",\n        "Vidar Hepsø",\n        "Mary Ann Lundteigen"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Discover Artificial Intelligence",\n      "abstract": "Abstract As one of the most important assets in the transportation of oil and gas products, subsea pipelines are susceptible to various environmental hazards, such as mechanical damage and corrosion, that can compromise their structural integrity and cause catastrophic environmental and financial damage. Autonomous underwater systems (AUS) are expected to assist offshore operations personnel and contribute to subsea pipeline inspection, maintenance, and damage detection tasks. Despite the promise of increased safety, AUS technology needs to mature, especially for image-based inspections with computer vision methods that analyze incoming images and detect potential pipeline damage through anomaly detection. Recent research addresses some of the most significant computer vision challenges for subsea environments, including visibility, color, and shape reconstruction. However, despite th...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用基于图像和风险信息的方法检测海底管道损伤，以解决训练数据不足和风险知识整合的挑战？",\n        "methods": [\n          "分析行业提供的海底管道图像",\n          "利用风险分析见解生成合成数据",\n          "评估通用计算机视觉方法"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "行业提供的海底管道图像"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种结合风险信息的方法来应对计算机视觉方法在海底管道损伤检测中的挑战",\n          "通过风险分析生成合成数据以弥补训练数据不足的问题"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "缺乏训练数据用于可靠的图像分析",\n          "难以将基于风险的知识整合到现有方法中"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "通过生成合成数据增加了检测管道损伤的可靠性"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文针对海底管道损伤检测中训练数据不足和风险知识整合困难的问题，提出了一种基于图像和风险信息的方法，通过分析行业图像、评估计算机视觉方法并利用风险分析生成合成数据，以提高自主水下系统检测的可靠性。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题‘港口集装箱损伤检测’高度相关，均涉及基于图像的损伤检测和训练数据不足问题，且提出了创新性的风险信息整合方法，值得深入阅读以借鉴其方法论。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.35784/iapgos.3434",\n      "title": "FEATURES OF THE IMPLEMENTATION OF COMPUTER VISION IN THE PROBLEMS OF AUTOMATED PRODUCT QUALITY CONTROL",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "Nataliia Stelmakh",\n        "Ihor Mastenko",\n        "Olga Sulima",\n        "Тетяна Олександрівна Рудик"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Informatyka Automatyka Pomiary w Gospodarce i Ochronie Środowiska",\n      "abstract": "The article analyzes the fields of application of machine vision. Special attention is focused on the application of Machine Vision in intelligent technological systems for product quality control. An important aspect is a quick and effective analysis of product quality directly at the stage of the technological process with high accuracy in determining product defects. The appropriateness and perspective of using the mathematical apparatus of artificial neural networks for the development of an intelligent technological system for monitoring the geometric state of products have been demonstrated. The purpose of this study is focused on the identification and classification of reed tuber quality parameters. For this purpose, new methods of identification and classification of quality control of various types of defects using computer vision and machine learning algorithms were proposed.",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用计算机视觉和机器学习算法实现产品（特别是芦苇块茎）质量参数的自动识别与分类？",\n        "methods": [\n          "计算机视觉",\n          "机器学习算法",\n          "人工神经网络"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了利用计算机视觉和机器学习算法进行产品缺陷识别和分类的新方法",\n          "论证了人工神经网络在产品质量几何状态监测智能技术系统中的适用性和前景"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [],\n        "short_summary": "本文分析了机器视觉在产品质量控制中的应用，重点研究了利用计算机视觉和机器学习算法识别和分类芦苇块茎质量参数的新方法，并论证了人工神经网络在该领域的适用性。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 40,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为通用产品质量控制，与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”不直接相关，且摘要中缺乏具体实验数据和结果，无法评估其适用性。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "BigDataSecurityHPSCIDS54978.2022.00034",\n      "title": "A Hybrid Deep Learning Anomaly Detection Framework for Intrusion Detection",\n      "year": 2022,\n      "authors": [\n        "Rahul Kale",\n        "Zhi Lu",\n        "Kar Wai Fok",\n        "Vrizlynn L. L. Thing"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Cyber intrusion attacks that compromise the users\' critical and sensitive data are escalating in volume and intensity, especially with the growing connections between our daily life and the Internet. The large volume and high complexity of such intrusion attacks have impeded the effectiveness of most traditional defence techniques. While at the same time, the remarkable performance of the machine learning methods, especially deep learning, in computer vision, had garnered research interests from the cyber security community to further enhance and automate intrusion detections. However, the expensive data labeling and limitation of anomalous data make it challenging to train an intrusion detector in a fully supervised manner. Therefore, intrusion detection based on unsupervised anomaly detection is an important feature too. In this paper, we propose a three-stage deep learning anomaly...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用混合深度学习异常检测框架提升网络入侵检测的性能？",\n        "methods": [\n          "三阶段深度学习异常检测框架",\n          "无监督学习（K-means聚类）",\n          "半监督学习（GANomaly）",\n          "监督学习（CNN）"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "NSL-KDD",\n          "CIC-IDS2018",\n          "TON_IoT"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种集成无监督、半监督和监督学习的混合深度学习异常检测框架",\n          "在三个基准数据集上评估了框架的性能"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "框架在NSL-KDD、CIC-IDS2018和TON_IoT数据集上展示了性能"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种三阶段混合深度学习异常检测框架，结合K-means聚类、GANomaly和CNN算法，用于网络入侵检测，并在三个基准数据集上进行了评估。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 65,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "摘要提供了研究问题、方法和数据集，但缺乏具体结果和局限性，且用户主题为港口集装箱损伤检测，与论文主题（网络入侵检测）不匹配，因此仅适合摘要阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.5194/isprs-annals-v-1-2021-121-2021",\n      "title": "DRONE-BASED CONTAINER CRANE INSPECTION: CONCEPT, CHALLENGES AND PRELIMINARY RESULTS",\n      "year": 2021,\n      "authors": [\n        "Mehdi Maboudi",\n        "Ahmed Alamouri",\n        "Vanessa De Arriba López",\n        "M. S. Bajauri",\n        "C. Berger",\n        "M. Gerke"\n      ],\n      "venue": "ISPRS annals of the photogrammetry, remote sensing and spatial information sciences",\n      "abstract": "Abstract. Container crane inspection is a very important task to maintain their uninterrupted operation. Nevertheless, this is a costly and time-consuming activity if performed manually. Recently, image-based detection of surface damages or changes using drones has gained increasing interest in industry; especially when objects of interest have a complex structure like container cranes. One main aim of this paper is a single-epoch image analysis which will also serve later for multi-epoch processing. It provides reliable information about current defects that may lead to big damages if not inspected by experts. Naïve Bayes classifier is employed to classify the images in different classes of which critical defects and especially rust is important. The preliminary results show that the precision on the target class reached about 99%. However, 87% percent recall in this class is not eno...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用无人机进行集装箱起重机检测，实现单时期图像分析以识别表面缺陷（尤其是锈蚀），并设计高效的数据管理系统以支持全自动化？",\n        "methods": [\n          "Naïve Bayes classifier"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "未明确说明具体数据集"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出基于无人机的集装箱起重机检测概念",\n          "实现单时期图像分析以识别缺陷",\n          "设计数据库概念以集成原始数据、中间结果和最终结果",\n          "连接集成客户端界面以在虚拟地球中检索数据"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "召回率（87%）不足，需要改进"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "目标类别的精度达到约99%",\n          "召回率为87%"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文提出基于无人机的集装箱起重机检测概念，使用朴素贝叶斯分类器进行单时期图像分析以识别缺陷（尤其是锈蚀），初步结果显示精度约99%但召回率87%不足；同时设计了集成原始数据、中间结果和最终结果的数据库概念，并连接客户端界面以支持数据检索。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”高度相关，涉及无人机检测和缺陷识别，且提供了初步结果和数据库概念，但召回率不足需进一步阅读全文了解改进方法。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "978-3-030-17795-9",\n      "title": "Deep Learning vs. Traditional Computer Vision",\n      "year": 2019,\n      "authors": [\n        "Niall O\' Mahony",\n        "Sean Campbell",\n        "Anderson Carvalho",\n        "Suman Harapanahalli",\n        "Gustavo Velasco-Hernandez",\n        "Lenka Krpalkova",\n        "Daniel Riordan",\n        "Joseph Walsh"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Deep Learning has pushed the limits of what was possible in the domain of Digital Image Processing. However, that is not to say that the traditional computer vision techniques which had been undergoing progressive development in years prior to the rise of DL have become obsolete. This paper will analyse the benefits and drawbacks of each approach. The aim of this paper is to promote a discussion on whether knowledge of classical computer vision techniques should be maintained. The paper will also explore how the two sides of computer vision can be combined. Several recent hybrid methodologies are reviewed which have demonstrated the ability to improve computer vision performance and to tackle problems not suited to Deep Learning. For example, combining traditional computer vision techniques with Deep Learning has been popular in emerging domains such as Panoramic Vision and 3D vision...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "深度学习与传统计算机视觉方法的优缺点比较，以及两者如何结合以提升性能。",\n        "methods": [],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [],\n        "short_summary": "该论文分析了深度学习与传统计算机视觉方法的优缺点，并探讨了如何将两者结合，特别是在全景视觉和3D视觉等新兴领域。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 10,\n        "decision": "insufficient",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”无关，摘要中未涉及任何相关方法、数据集或结果。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "RG.2.2.33612.46722",\n      "title": "A New Benchmark Dataset for Texture Image Analysis and Surface Defect Detection",\n      "year": 2019,\n      "authors": [\n        "Shervan Fekri-Ershad"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Texture analysis plays an important role in many image processing applications to describe the image content or objects. On the other hand, visual surface defect detection is a highly research field in the computer vision. Surface defect refers to abnormalities in the texture of the surface. So, in this paper a dual purpose benchmark dataset is proposed for texture image analysis and surface defect detection titled stone texture image (STI dataset). The proposed benchmark dataset consist of 4 different class of stone texture images. The proposed benchmark dataset have some unique properties to make it very near to real applications. Local rotation, different zoom rates, unbalanced classes, variation of textures in size are some properties of the proposed dataset. In the result part, some descriptors are applied on this dataset to evaluate the proposed STI dataset in comparison with ot...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何构建一个用于纹理图像分析和表面缺陷检测的双用途基准数据集？",\n        "methods": [],\n        "datasets": [\n          "STI dataset"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一个名为STI的双用途基准数据集，用于纹理图像分析和表面缺陷检测",\n          "该数据集包含4类石材纹理图像，具有局部旋转、不同缩放率、类别不平衡、纹理大小变化等接近真实应用的特性"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "在STI数据集上应用了一些描述子，并与当前最先进的数据集进行了比较评估"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文提出了一个名为STI的双用途基准数据集，用于纹理图像分析和表面缺陷检测，包含4类石材纹理图像，具有局部旋转、不同缩放率、类别不平衡、纹理大小变化等接近真实应用的特性，并在该数据集上应用了一些描述子进行评估。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 40,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "摘要仅介绍了数据集的设计和初步评估，缺乏具体结果和与用户主题（港口集装箱损伤检测）的直接关联，且未提供足够的技术细节以支持深入阅读。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/app8091678",\n      "title": "Research on a Surface Defect Detection Algorithm Based on MobileNet-SSD",\n      "year": 2018,\n      "authors": [\n        "Yiting Li",\n        "Haisong Huang",\n        "Qingsheng Xie",\n        "Liguo Yao",\n        "Qipeng Chen"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Applied Sciences",\n      "abstract": "This paper aims to achieve real-time and accurate detection of surface defects by using a deep learning method. For this purpose, the Single Shot MultiBox Detector (SSD) network was adopted as the meta structure and combined with the base convolution neural network (CNN) MobileNet into the MobileNet-SSD. Then, a detection method for surface defects was proposed based on the MobileNet-SSD. Specifically, the structure of the SSD was optimized without sacrificing its accuracy, and the network structure and parameters were adjusted to streamline the detection model. The proposed method was applied to the detection of typical defects like breaches, dents, burrs and abrasions on the sealing surface of a container in the filling line. The results show that our method can automatically detect surface defects more accurately and rapidly than lightweight network methods and traditional machine...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何实现港口集装箱表面缺陷的实时准确检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "采用MobileNet-SSD深度学习网络",\n          "优化SSD结构以保持精度并精简模型",\n          "调整网络结构和参数"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "灌装线集装箱密封面的典型缺陷（如裂缝、凹痕、毛刺、磨损）数据集"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出基于MobileNet-SSD的表面缺陷检测方法",\n          "实现比轻量级网络和传统机器学习方法更准确、更快速的自动检测"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "该方法能自动检测表面缺陷，准确性和速度优于轻量级网络和传统机器学习方法"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文采用MobileNet-SSD深度学习网络，通过优化SSD结构和参数，实现了对灌装线集装箱密封面典型缺陷（如裂缝、凹痕、毛刺、磨损）的实时准确检测，结果优于轻量级网络和传统机器学习方法。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 70,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题高度相关，涉及集装箱表面缺陷检测，且方法具有创新性，但摘要中缺乏具体性能数据和场景适配性说明，需要深入阅读全文以评估其实际应用价值。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "1404.7174v7",\n      "title": "Computer vision-based recognition of liquid surfaces and phase boundaries in transparent vessels, with emphasis on chemistry applications",\n      "year": 2014,\n      "authors": [\n        "Sagi Eppel",\n        "Tal Kachman"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "The ability to recognize the liquid surface and the liquid level in transparent containers is perhaps the most commonly used evaluation method when dealing with fluids. Such recognition is essential in determining the liquid volume, fill level, phase boundaries and phase separation in various fluid systems. The recognition of liquid surfaces is particularly important in solution chemistry, where it is essential to many laboratory techniques (e.g., extraction, distillation, titration). A general method for the recognition of interfaces between liquid and air or between phase-separating liquids could have a wide range of applications and contribute to the understanding of the visual properties of such interfaces. This work examines a computer vision method for the recognition of liquid surfaces and liquid levels in various transparent containers. The method can be applied to recognition...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用计算机视觉方法识别透明容器中的液体表面和相界面，特别是在化学应用中的液体-空气和液体-液体界面。",\n        "methods": [\n          "计算机视觉方法，通过扫描图像中所有可能的曲线来匹配液体表面轮廓",\n          "利用相对强度变化、边缘密度变化和梯度方向相对于曲线法线的图像属性来评估曲线与真实液体表面的对应程度"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种通用的液体表面和相界面识别方法，无需预先知道相的数量",\n          "该方法可同时应用于液体-空气和液体-液体界面的识别"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "识别液体表面的最佳图像属性是相对强度变化、边缘密度变化和梯度方向相对于曲线法线的方向"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种计算机视觉方法，用于识别透明容器中的液体表面和相界面，通过扫描可能的曲线并评估图像属性来匹配真实界面，适用于化学实验中的液体处理。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 15,\n        "decision": "insufficient",\n        "reason": "论文主题为液体表面识别，与用户主题“港口集装箱损伤检测”无关，且摘要中未提及任何与集装箱或损伤检测相关的内容。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    }\n  ]\n}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'medium', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.2}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740/runs", "run_id": "run_abc3fcaca9164d70ac2d7c7d70a2f67e", "session_key": "b28569c2810d4c95a568626d927b3740", "turn_id": "834e741a-5514-4b36-8a6c-8f05e80a1c81"}
